 - **Extrema Outside Interval**: Extrema outside $[t_0, t_1]$ are ignored [S1, unofficial].
 - **Sign Equality**: If $f_0$ and $f_1$ have the same sign after isolation, no root exists in the segment [S1, unofficial].
-- **Division by Zero**: If $f_1 \approx f_0$ during refinement, the denominator becomes small. The pseudocode handles this by falling back to bisection (midpoint) [G].
